      {
        "text": "The goal is to build widespread public support among Oregonians.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "Abortion needs persist despite legal restrictions.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Universal access to care includes affordability, availability, and quality of healthcare.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
