    "turn_text": "I'm doing great. We're very grateful to have you on the podcast. And when I was preparing for the conversation today, I was looking through your background. And the first thing that jumped out that I wanted to ask you about was your experience working in Congress, not as a member of Congress, but as a staffer, you worked for Senator Harry Reid, Representative Pete Stark, some big personalities in the national political world. So what was the experience like working for Senator Reid, for example, when you were a staffer?",
