    "turn_idx": 54,
    "turn_text": "So I wanna take the steps that get us to universal access to care. And for me, and we had a hearing on this, I think it was this past year, and I hold out the belief that one day we are going, and to me, universal access to care means that everybody has access to affordable healthcare when they need it at an affordable price, and that care is quality care that improves their health outcomes. That's what that means to me. We can get there in many different forms. We can get there under a single pair system, which to me is like, oh, right?",
